    "created_at": "2016-10-19T07:50:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T07:50:59Z",
    "body": "> I am against removing this section from HTML. I know you think it should belong in some other spec, but nobody is volunteering to write that spec, and I'm not comfortable removing the one piece of guidance that the platform has in this area. I think we should keep the section and also restore the deleted text.\n\nWhat guidance does it contain though? That a mouse click fires a click? UI events already says that.\n",
