    "created_at": "2016-10-19T16:46:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T16:46:41Z",
    "body": "Gecko has just a boolean flag for click() handling, and given that we've managed to live with that, I'd hope the spec could rely on similar thing too, and not add anything too complicated.\n\nhttp://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/d96317a351af8aa78ab9847e7feed964bbaac7d7/dom/html/nsGenericHTMLElement.cpp#2561,2563-2564,2578,2589\nhttp://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/d96317a351af8aa78ab9847e7feed964bbaac7d7/dom/base/nsINode.h#1774-1776\n",
